This directory includes scripts to run simulated tuning with search method guided by performance counters.

For instructions on how to run them, see associated paper.

The autobench.py script needs to have *py scripts located here in the same folder, read raw tuning data from 'raw-autotuning-data' folder, read models from 'models' folder, and, depending on method, store result into one of 'benchmarks-exact', 'benchmarks-dt' and 'benchmarks-ls' folder (which must exist).
